  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Citizen Security Through A Multi-Stakeholder Partnership (CSTAMP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Citizen Security Through A Multi-Stakeholder Partnership (CSTAMP) seeks to support and strengthen existing endeavors of civil society organisations (CSOs); to create new opportunities for collaboration on decisions and actions and, on this basis, enable an effective path to sustainable reduction in crime and violence in 3 targeted communities.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
